WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Materials decision. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Balance mass, cost, safety and repair

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A materials decision balances performance, mass, cost, safety, process and repairability. No material is best in every context.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Create a weighted decision table and mark each score as evidence, estimate or assumption.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Evidence matrix

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Balance mass, cost, safety and repair
